category: Net
requires: cygwin libbz2_1 libcares2 libevent2.1_7 libgcc1 liblzma5 libssl3 libstdc++6 libwrap0 zlib0
sdesc: "Yet another implementation of an HTTP proxy for Debian/Ubuntu software packages written in C++"
ldesc: "A caching proxy. Specialized for package files from Linux distributors,
primarily for Debian (and Debian based) distributions but not limited to
those. See documentation of Apt-Cacher to learn what it's good for."

